==Icelandic==

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|hugsaði|hugsað}}
# {{context|ambitransitive|governs the accusative}} to [[think]]{{jump|is|think|s}}
#: ''Ég þarf að '''hugsa''' þetta mál.''
#:: I need to '''think''' this through.
#: ''Hann hefur aldrei '''hugsað''' út í þetta.''
#:: He's never '''considdered''' it.
# to [[believe]], to [[guess]]{{jump|is|believe|s}}
#: ''Ég '''hugsa''' það.''
#:: I '''guess''' so.

